# Day-to-day: decision tree: choosing a database, nested yes/no diamonds ending in leaf nodes.
title "Which database?"
dir DOWN
q1{Relational data?} :yellow
q2{Need strong consistency?} :yellow
q3{Mostly key lookups?} :yellow
q4{Graph queries?} :yellow
pg[(PostgreSQL)] :teal
spanner[(Distributed SQL)] :teal
kv[(Key-value store)] :teal
graph[(Graph DB)] :teal
doc[(Document DB)] :teal
q1 -> q2 : yes
q1 -> q3 : no
q2 -> pg : single node
q2 -> spanner : global
q3 -> kv : yes
q3 -> q4 : no
q4 -> graph : yes
q4 -> doc : no
